abstract: >-
  Engram MCP is a zero-dependency, pure Python stdlib MCP server
  that gives AI agents (Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf) persistent
  memory across sessions using SQLite FTS5. No cloud, no Docker,
  no API costs.
